        },
        {
          "id": "line-ff3a15abb38599bb",
          "en": "Surge's damage is increased",
          "ru": "Священного Всплеска повышается"
        },
        {
          "id": "line-767aa50f413a9ed0",
          "en": "by <num>%.",
          "ru": "на §#AAAAAA<num>§#AAAAAA%."
        },
        {
          "id": "item-description-59798b56b95f8940",
          "en": "<em>There is very little outside the",
          "ru": "<em>§7Людям с властью доступно"
        },
        {
          "id": "item-description-24595c70b98666d2",
          "en": "<em>purview of those with power. No",
          "ru": "<em>§7почти всё. При любых"
        },
        {
          "id": "item-description-9bd74d8da25ac033",
          "en": "<em>matter the circumstance, those in",
          "ru": "<em>§7обстоятельствах вышестоящие"
        },
        {
          "id": "item-description-ed4a0bec9c53024a",
          "en": "<em>a higher position can, will, and",
          "ru": "<em>§7могут и будут оправдывать"
